===== ink:meta
kind: mindmap
===== ink:body
- jiyuu
  - Your maps
    - .ink: plain text you can edit anywhere
    - .mm: FreeMind and Freeplane maps
    - Export back to .mm
  - Editing
    - Add, rename, delete
    - Move nodes up, down and across
    - Undo and redo
    - Saved as you go
  - Viewing
    - Pan and zoom
    - Fold any branch
    - Colour themes
      - tokyonight-night
      - nord
      - nord-frost
      - nord-aurora
      - solarized-dark
  - Keyboard first
    - Arrow keys to move around
    - F2, or just start typing
    - Escape: back to the root
